  "title": "Big Germans",
  "description": "An oven pancake that puffs up and falls. It is served with a squeeze of lemon juice and powdered sugar. We also enjoy them topped with fresh strawberries and whipped cream. Serves 2 to 4.",
  "authors": [
    "Jeanie Bean"
  ],
